{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】大埔富善邨有男住戶疑遭匪徒入屋行劫襲擊，金鏈、金鈪及現金被搶，損失總值67萬元。</p>\n<p>警員在地下保安崗位翻看閉路電視調查。下午1時許，警方接報富善邨善美樓發生入屋行劫案，84歲男住戶疑遭人尾隨入屋，被打傷及搶去金鏈、電話、銀包、現金等，匪徒事後逃去。救護員接報到場，事主頭部及四肢受傷，送到大埔那打素醫院治理。</p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T14:24:02.458594+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T12:06:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T14:37:15.024161+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T14:17:33.380998+00:00","content_hash":"89c27d848d2f6f374a7310a4700c6ed45ffe1de690a7a3d267ca8dd682e24e8a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":"fetch failed: TimeoutError","content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T14:24:02.458594+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-fetch-error","latest_error":"fetch failed: TimeoutError"},"content_capture":null}